<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:48:37 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6753a25e7f8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一台打字机，一个皮卷，一部旋转拨号电话。阿纳姆露天博物馆的一张书桌。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a black typewriter, a brown leather roll, a rotary phone situated on a desk" height="1365" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a6753a25e7f8.jpg" width="2048"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:48:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6753690b580</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个古老的荷兰咖啡馆，正如在阿纳姆露天博物馆所见&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="an old Dutch cafe, as seen at the Openlucht Museum Arnhem. There is a bicycle parked in front of the cafe." height="1398" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a6753690b580.jpg" width="2048"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:47:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a675333ba48c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在炎热中凉爽下来真好。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Girl in a swimming pool throwing her hair back. " height="1080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/furstenberg/6a675333ba48c.jpg" width="1920"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://furstenberg.some.pics"&gt;@furstenberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:46:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>史上最美狗狗</title><link>https://some.pics/6a674796acaf7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;有史以来最漂亮的狗！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A black dog sitting and looking at the camera" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a674796acaf7.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 11:57:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a67163c9a67a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;逃到加拿大惠斯勒避暑！！这里是菲茨西蒙斯溪。我第一次真正踏上加拿大（我曾去过尼亚加拉瀑布加拿大一侧大约30分钟，但仅此而已——直到现在）！这里太美了💕&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A fast-flowing, pale green stream of glacial water flowing through a dense evergreen forest lined with rocky banks." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sjwallin/6a67163c9a67a.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sjwallin.some.pics"&gt;@sjwallin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 08:26:47 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>